Public keys (minisign, *.pub) that releases of TitanOS must be signed with.

An update is installed only if the manifest of the release carries a valid
signature of one of the keys in this directory. An image without a key
installs no updates at all.

The first published image must contain distinct release and offline recovery
public keys. Neither private key belongs in this repository. Keep the recovery
secret offline; only the release secret goes into the protected release
environment. More keys may be added during rotation: an update that adds the
new key is signed with an existing trusted key before switching signers.

rehearsal.pub is a disposable test key, ignored by Git. Tag builds reject it.

See docs/RELEASING.md in the repository.
